Acts 24:1 , Paul being accused by Tertullus the orator
Acts 24:10 . answers for his life and doctrine;
Acts 24:24 , He preaches Christ to the governor and his wife;
Acts 24:26 , The governor hopes for a bribe, but in vain;
Acts 24:27 , At last, going out of his office, he leaves Paul in prison.
